('0588262001', '0588262', 'LOGG Naomi padded', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Blue', 'Medium', 'Outwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Outdoor', 'Padded jacket in woven fabric with a slight sheen. Stand-up collar, zip and wind flap with concealed press-studs down the front and pockets in the side seams. Inner ribbing at the cuffs and a drawstring at the hem. Lined. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
