('0610665001', '0610665', 'Hilly strapless dress LT', 'Underdress', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Functional Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Short, strapless slip with a padded balconette bra in sturdy microfibre. Slip with a gentle shaping effect on the tummy, bum and thighs. Bra with underwired, moulded cups with extra-thick padding to lift and shape the bust. Silicone trim at the top and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back. Laser-cut hem with a silicone trim at the front. Shoulder straps included.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0610665002', '0610665', 'Hilly strapless dress LT', 'Underdress', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Functional Lingerie', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Lingerie', 'Under-, Nightwear', 'Short, strapless slip with a padded balconette bra in sturdy microfibre. Slip with a gentle shaping effect on the tummy, bum and thighs. Bra with underwired, moulded cups with extra-thick padding to lift and shape the bust. Silicone trim at the top and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back. Laser-cut hem with a silicone trim at the front. Shoulder straps included.', NULL, 0, 0),
