('0613522001', '0613522', 'Souffle', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Straight-cut, calf-length dress in woven fabric with a frilled collar and buttons down the front. Long, wide sleeves with a seam and frill trim at the top and elastication at the cuffs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613529001', '0613529', 'CE Malva dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Grey', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short, straight dress in a Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave containing glittery threads. Draped style with an opening and concealed zip at the back and covered button at the back of the neck, and long raglan sleeves with wide, buttoned cuffs in a contrasting colour. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613530001', '0613530', 'CE Myrtle dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Metallic', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Calf-length dress in a Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave containing glittery threads. Narrow cut at the top with straight, gentle draping, a high collar, gathers down the front and ties at the neck. Deep V-neck at the back and a seam at the hem with a flared skirt and slit at the front. Slightly longer at the back. Lined bodice.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613531001', '0613531', 'CE Hibiscus bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Soft, non-wired bra in lace made from recycled nylon with narrow, adjustable shoulder straps and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613531002', '0613531', 'CE Hibiscus bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Soft, non-wired bra in lace made from recycled nylon with narrow, adjustable shoulder straps and a hook-and-eye fastening at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613532002', '0613532', 'CE Aster panty', 'Underwear bottom', 'Underwear', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Briefs in lace made from recycled nylon with a mid waist, lined gusset, wide sides and medium coverage at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613533001', '0613533', 'CE Tulip trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Green', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Jacquard-weave trousers in recycled polyester and nylon containing glittery threads. High waist, zip fly and concealed hook-and-eye fastener, concealed pockets in the side seams and a fake back pocket. Fitted at the top with straight legs with sewn-in creases and slits at the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613534001', '0613534', 'CE Physalis top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Green', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Top in an airy, patterned Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave with an opening with a covered button at the top and gathered seam at the front. V-neck at the back, dropped shoulders and short puff sleeves with pleats and elasticated sleeve-ends.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613535001', '0613535', 'CE Snowdrop dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Short, straight-cut dress in EcoNyl® mesh with organic cotton embroidery. Small stand-up collar, covered buttons at the back, dropped shoulders and long puff sleeves with flared cuffs and a covered button. Fitted underdress.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613538003', '0613538', 'CE Ruby skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Green', 'Medium', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Skirt in a recycled polyester jacquard weave containing glittery threads with a concealed zip at the back and patch front pockets. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613539001', '0613539', 'CE Ivy lace dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Lace', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Long dress in EcoNyl® with organic cotton embroidery in a narrow cut at the top with a double flounce around the neckline and covered buttons down the back. The dress is fitted and flares to the hem with inset panels for added width. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613541001', '0613541', 'CE Geranium dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Long, airy V-neck dress in a sturdy linen and silk weave that is fitted at the top with raw, overlocked edges. Concealed zip at the back, seam at the waist with pleats, a flared skirt with draping and a seam at the hem with a wide flounce. Lined. The linen content of the dress is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613542001', '0613542', 'CE Wallflower dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Long dress in an airy, patterned weave made from recycled polyester with a sturdy turtle neck with gathers and a draped front. Opening at the back with concealed press-studs at the back of the neck and a gathered seam at the waist with a drawstring that ties at the sides. Heavily draping skirt with an inset panel in a contrasting colour at the back. Lined skirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0613544001', '0613544', 'CE Magnolia blazer', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Jacquard', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Oversized, single-breasted jacket in a jacquard weave made from recycled polyester. Straight style with straight notch lapels, welt front pockets and an extra high single back vent. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0);
