('0613546001', '0613546', 'CE Rudbeckia shirt', 'Shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'CONSCIOUS EXCLUSIVE. Oversized shirt in an organic cotton weave with a grandad collar with a covered button, concealed buttons down the front and a yoke at the back with a pleat for added width. Raglan sleeves with wide cuffs with a slit, buttons down the sleeves and at the sides, and a rounded hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
