('0621251001', '0621251', 'The small V', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Lace', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey Occasion', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Premium', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Lace top with short cap sleeves. V-neck with a lace trim at the top and scalloped trims at the sleeves and hem. Partly lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
