('0626463002', '0626463', 'Lola dress checked', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Check', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Knee-length dress in sturdy jersey with a seam at the waist and short puff sleeves with close-fitting cuffs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0626476001', '0626476', 'Clark skinny', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers woven in a stretch wool blend with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener and zip fly. Diagonal side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0626476002', '0626476', 'Clark skinny', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers woven in a stretch wool blend with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener and zip fly. Diagonal side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0626484001', '0626484', 'SB Berg overall', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Kids Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded all-in-one suit in wind- and waterproof, breathable functional fabric with closed seams, a detachable lined hood with a detachable faux fur trim and a zip and wind flap with a hook and loop fastening and chin guard at the front. Chest pocket with a flap and press-stud, front pockets with a waterproof zip, an adjustable elasticated waist and elastication at the cuffs and hems. Reinforced legs and back, reinforced elastic strap under the feet and reflective details. The suit has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
